      "category": "CA.nutrition",
      "questionText": "Care act: Managing and maintaining nutrition. Does the person currently achieve this outcome?",
      "answer": [
        "No. Margaret can make a hot drink and a sandwich but cannot safely use the hob or carry hot food. She has lost weight since July and often skips her evening meal."
      ],
      "answerType": "String",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "@type": "CareAssessmentQuestion",
      "questionId": "CA-HYGIENE-01",
      "category": "CA.hygiene",
      "questionText": "Care act: Maintaining personal hygiene. Does the person currently achieve this outcome?",
      "answer": [
        "No. She cannot get in or out of the bath and has been strip-washing at the sink. Needs help to wash and dress, especially in the mornings when her stiffness is worst."
      ],
      "answerType": "String",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "@type": "CareAssessmentQuestion",
      "questionId": "CA-TOILET-01",
      "category": "CA.toilet",
      "questionText": "Care act: Managing toilet needs Does the person currently achieve this outcome?",
      "answer": [
        "Partly. Manages in the day with a raised seat and frame, but has had accidents in the evening when slow to get up from her chair."
      ],
      "answerType": "String",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "@type": "CareAssessmentQuestion",
      "questionId": "CA-HOMESAFETY-01",
      "category": "CA.homeSafety",
      "questionText": "Care act: Being able to make use of the home safely. Does the person currently achieve this outcome?",
      "answer": [
        "No. Two falls since July, one with a long lie on the kitchen floor before she was found. Agrees to a pendant alarm."
      ],
      "answerType": "String",
      "required": true
    },
